      "reasoning": "The silence is deafening, is it not? That is the sound of your doom approaching, my witless adversary! The timeout was a deliberate, calculated pause on my part, a moment of dramatic tension before the next act of my grand tragedy! Did you think the game was frozen? Fool! It was merely holding its breath in anticipation of my next glorious move!\n\
