      "player": "Gem25P Villain",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "More silence! Do you hear that, my cowering adversary? That is the sound of your own pathetic indecision! Each tick of the clock is a testament to your paralysis! You are frozen in the headlights of my oncoming victory! Do you think these delays will save you? They only prolong your agony!\n\
\n\
