      "ts": "2026-02-12T19:20:57.486-08:00",
      "player": "Gem25P Villain",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Still, you do nothing! You are broken! My sheer, unadulterated villainy has shattered your will to fight! Your mind is a desolate wasteland, unable to conjure even the simplest of strategies! This is a victory more profound than mere life points! I have crushed your very spirit!\n\
\n\
Do you think these \"timeouts\" are a system error? No! They are a manifestation of your complete and utter mental collapse! The game itself cannot comprehend such pathetic inaction! It waits for you, but you have nothing to offer! You are a hollow shell, a testament to my ultimate triumph!\n\
\n\
