      "player": "Gem25P Villain",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "The silence stretches on, a beautiful, agonizing symphony of my opponent's cowardice! Tick-tock, little hero, tick-tock! Do you think these delays will save you? Do you imagine some divine intervention will rescue you from my clutches? Fool! Time is a weapon, and right now, it is an instrument of torture that I am wielding with masterful precision!\n\
