      "decision_index": 113,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "At 1 life facing a 2/3 flying Slickshot Show-Off, discarding Swamp to pump a tapped Psychic Frog doesn't help survive the next attack. The +1/+1 counter on a tapped creature doesn't address the immediate lethal threat, and discarding the Swamp loses a potential land drop for future mana.",
      "action_taken": "Discarded Swamp to activate Psychic Frog's ability, putting a +1/+1 counter on the tapped Frog.",
      "better_line": "Hold the Swamp to play as a land drop, keeping mana open for March of Wretched Sorrow with X=2 (3 mana) next turn to kill the Slickshot Show-Off and gain 2 life, or cast March now for X=1 to gain 1 life as a buffer against the lethal threat.",
      "type": "blunder",
